<!-- Lanius crew names (docs/NAMES.md): metals, alloys and materials, the longer and heavier the better, and the gases
     (the Lanius take the oxygen from a room: the nitrogen and argon are what's left behind them).

     sex: B (both), M or F, chosen by how a name sounds. A female crew member given a B name gets it with one of the
     endings in <female>, picked at random: ex="..." leaves out an ending that reads wrong on that name. A name ending
     in one of the drop endings loses it first (Titanium, Titania); a name already ending in one of the endings is its
     own female form; a final E drops before an ending that starts with a vowel (Bronze, Bronzia).
     rarity: where the name comes from (docs/NAMES.md): real metals by how well known, then names from folk speech and
     myth, from one story, and made up here. A name comes up in proportion to its level's weight. No rarity is the first.

     To change them, copy this file into names in the lore folder beside the program and edit the copy. -->
<names race="lanius">
